<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 24pt">&#160;</p>

<ix:continuation continuedAt="_LesseeLeasesPolicyTextBlock-c0_cont_14" id="_LesseeLeasesPolicyTextBlock-c0_cont_13"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" continuedAt="_ScheduleOfFutureMinimumLeasePaymentsForCapitalLeasesTableTextBlock-c0_cont_1" escape="true" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfFutureMinimumLeasePaymentsForCapitalLeasesTableTextBlock">Lease payments receivable for
the following five&#160;years as of June 30, 2023 were as follows:</ix:nonNumeric></p></ix:continuation>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 24pt">&#160;</p>

