<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">Provision for credit
losses for prepayment and other current assets for the year ended December 31, 2022 and the six months ended June 30, 2023 were
RMB<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c1" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OtherAssetsCurrent" scale="3" unitRef="cny">10,396</ix:nonFraction> and RMB<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c2" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OtherAssetsCurrent" scale="3" unitRef="cny">3,899</ix:nonFraction>, respectively. The effect of adopting ASC 326 was RMB<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="uk:RetainedEarnings" scale="3" unitRef="cny">85</ix:nonFraction> credit losses recorded and increased in the opening
balance of accumulated deficit.</p></ix:nonNumeric><div>
</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 24pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24pt">&#160;</p><div>

