<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 24pt">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">The loss from termination
of leases for the&#160;six months ended June 30, 2022 and 2023 were RMB<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c7" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:GainLossOnTerminationOfLease" scale="3" unitRef="cny">13,089</ix:nonFraction> and RMB<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:GainLossOnTerminationOfLease" scale="3" unitRef="cny">5,054</ix:nonFraction>, respectively and recorded in other income/(expense),
net in the condensed consolidated statement of operations.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 24pt">&#160;</p>

