of<br/> December&#160;31,<br/>
2022</b></p></td><td style="padding-bottom: 1.5pt">&#160;</td><td style="font-weight: bold; padding-bottom: 1.5pt">&#160;</td>
    <td colspan="2" style="font-weight: bold; text-align: center; border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid">As of <br/> June 30, <br/> 2023</td><td style="padding-bottom: 1.5pt; font-weight: bold">&#160;</td></tr>
