<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">The aggregate intrinsic value
was calculated as the difference between the exercise price of the underlying awards and the closing stock price of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c149" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="uk:ClosingStockPrice" scale="0" unitRef="usdPershares">0.559</ix:nonFraction> of the Company&#8217;s
ordinary share on June 30, 2023.</p><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">&#160;</p></ix:continuation><div>

</div><div>

