<ix:continuation id="_ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValueTableTextBlock-c0_cont_2"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%"> <tr style="vertical-align: top"> <td style="width: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">*</span></td> <td style="text-align: justify"><ix:footnote id="ix_9_footnote" xml:lang="en-US"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">In connection with the SPAC transaction effective date on November 17, 2020, the Company adopted the 2020 Plan and replace the 2019 Plan. Therefore, the aggregated grant date fair value of options for the year ended December 31, 2019 of RMB<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c150" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardOptionsVestedInPeriodFairValue1" scale="3" unitRef="cny">575,788</ix:nonFraction> was replaced by RMB<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c151" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardOptionsVestedInPeriodFairValue1" scale="3" unitRef="cny">275,402</ix:nonFraction>. The aggregated grant date fair value of options granted in 2020 was RMB<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c152" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardOptionsVestedInPeriodFairValue1" scale="3" unitRef="cny">98,430</ix:nonFraction>.</span></ix:footnote></td></tr> </table></ix:continuation>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">As of June 30, 2023, there
was approximately RMB<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c153" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsAggregateIntrinsicValueNonvested" scale="3" unitRef="cny">4,646</ix:nonFraction> of total unrecognized compensation cost related to unvested share options. The unrecognized compensation costs
are expected to be recognized over a weighted average period of <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c149" format="ixt-sec:duryear" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardOptionsOutstandingWeightedAverageRemainingContractualTerm2">0.28</ix:nonNumeric>&#160;years.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">&#160;</p>

