<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">The Company reversed RMB<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c52" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" scale="0" unitRef="usd">25,121</ix:nonFraction>
share-based compensation expense of earn-out shares related to prior years for the year ended December 31, 2022</p><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">&#160;</p></ix:continuation><div>

