<ix:continuation continuedAt="uk_ScheduleOfRelatedPartyBalanceTableTextBlock-c0_cont_8" id="uk_ScheduleOfRelatedPartyBalanceTableTextBlock-c0_cont_7"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; width: 100%"><tr style="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<td style="width: 0.25in; text-align: left"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(v)</span></td><td style="text-align: justify"><ix:footnote id="ix_15_footnote" xml:lang="en-US"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">In
September 2022, Angela Bai, spouse of Dr. Daqing Mao, entered into two loan agreements of RMB<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c175" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtDefaultLongtermDebtAmount" scale="3" unitRef="cny">3,500</ix:nonFraction> and RMB<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c176" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtDefaultLongtermDebtAmount" scale="3" unitRef="cny">8,500</ix:nonFraction> with the Group, respectively.
<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c177" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentMaturityDateDescription">One loan had an interest rate of 8.0% per annum with a maturity date of March 18, 2023, and the other had an interest rate of 8.0% per
annum with a maturity date of September 20, 2023.</ix:nonNumeric> Pursuant to the loan agreements, the loan must be repaid within <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" format="ixt-sec:durday" name="uk:MaturityDate">90</ix:nonNumeric> days of the maturity
date. The Group has repaid RMB<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c178" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="uk:RepaidLoanAmount" scale="0" unitRef="usd">1,000</ix:nonFraction> in April 2023 and RMB<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c179" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="uk:RepaidLoanAmount" scale="0" unitRef="usd">6,300</ix:nonFraction> in May 2023.</span></ix:footnote></td>
</tr></table></ix:continuation>

<p style="margin: 0">&#160;</p>

